{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25277","headline":"送日本使还 · 徐凝","name":"送日本使还","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"绝国将无外，扶桑更有东。\n来朝逢圣日，归去及秋风。\n夜泛潮回际，晨征苍莽中。\n鲸波腾水府，蜃气壮仙宫。\n天眷何期远，王文久已同。\n相望杳不见，离恨托飞鸿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐凝","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25277.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25277","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}